  m_text: "The holy sword Celestia pierced straight into the Demon King's heart,
    unleashing a brilliant divine light that burned away the darkness engulfing the
    castle.\n\nThe Demon King let out a final, agonized roar, his crimson eyes slowly
    fading.\n\n\"Do you think\u2026 killing me is the end?\" he sneered, his voice
    laced with mockery. \"Darkness\u2026 will never truly vanish\u2026 it only waits\u2026\""
