  m_text: "Before Phoenix could question him further, the Demon King\u2019s body
    crumbled into ashes, disappearing into nothingness.\n\nThe castle trembled violently,
    the ground splitting apart beneath his feet. Wasting no time, Phoenix pulled
    his sword free and sprinted out of the collapsing fortress.\n\nAs he emerged
    from the dark castle, the golden sunlight bathed the land of Eldoria."
